371	- [ ] **Task 8: Frontend-Tests (Vitest)** (AC: #1, #2, #3, #4) — neue Datei `seed-b-frontend/src/app/features/checkout/order-confirmation/order-confirmation.spec.ts`; geänderte Dateien `seed-b-frontend/src/app/core/services/order.service.spec.ts`, `seed-b-frontend/src/app/features/checkout/checkout.spec.ts`
